# Vendored assets

`src/mdreview/assets/ds/` contains a read-only snapshot of a design
system, copied 2026-07-31:

- `design-app/tokens.css` — design tokens + `@font-face` declarations
- `themes.css` — canonical themed color palette (imported by tokens.css)
- `components/components.css` — component styles (comment popover, inbox,
  badges, icons; all icons are inline data-URI SVG)
- `fonts/` — the six font files referenced by `tokens.css` (below), plus
  their license texts

## Font licenses

Both families are licensed under the **SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1**.
Per OFL condition 2, each family's full license text and copyright notice
ships alongside the binaries:

| files | family | license file |
|---|---|---|
| `AtkinsonHyperlegibleNext-*VariableFont_wght.ttf` | Atkinson Hyperlegible Next (variable) | `fonts/OFL-AtkinsonHyperlegibleNext.txt` |
| `JetBrainsMono-*.woff2` | JetBrains Mono | `fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt` |

Copyright notices were extracted from the binaries' own name tables
(2026-07-31):

- Atkinson Hyperlegible Next: "Copyright 2020-2024 The Atkinson Hyperlegible
  Next Project Authors" — upstream:
  https://github.com/googlefonts/atkinson-hyperlegible-next
- JetBrains Mono: "Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors" —
  upstream: https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono

Neither family declares a Reserved Font Name.

## Serving and overriding

These assets are served read-only by `md-review serve` at `/ds/...` (the
`.txt` license files are NOT web-served — the ds route is suffix-restricted
to css/fonts/svg). To develop against a live design-system checkout instead
of the snapshot, pass `--ds-dir /path/to/design-system` (or set
`MD_REVIEW_DS_DIR`). Note that `--ds-dir` content is served same-origin:
only point it at checkouts you trust as active web content.
